# 环境变量多层替换与路径传参示例，只访问 httpbin.org。

### 嵌套变量与查询参数
GET {{host}}/get?source={{meta.source}}&user={{name}}&env={{envName}}
Accept: application/json
X-Origin-Env: {{envName}}

### 请求体多处插值
POST {{host}}/post
Content-Type: application/json
X-Token: {{token}}

{
  "client": "{{name}}",
  "env": "{{envName}}",
  "meta": {
    "source": "{{meta.source}}"
  }
}

### 状态码路径参数
GET {{host}}/status/200?check={{name}}
Accept: application/json
